# Cart

```hdm-state
count: 2
price: 5
tags: ["mug", "oven"]
total: {count + price}
```

```hdm-action?name=cart.add&role=primary&on:click
args: { "sku": "oven-12l" }
---
Add {count} items
```

```hdm-region
when: {count > 0}
---
{total} in the cart
```

```hdm-text
each: item in tags
body: {item}
```

You owe {total} dollars.
